@api = http://localhost:5200
@idp = http://localhost:5143

### Lista produktow (publiczna)
GET {{api}}/api/products?color=Red

### Jeden produkt
GET {{api}}/api/products/1

### Logowanie - skopiuj accessToken do zmiennej ponizej
POST {{idp}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "alice", "password": "alicepass" }

###
@token = wklej-tutaj-token

### Klienci - wymagaja tokenu pracownika dzialu Sales
GET {{api}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Usuniecie produktu - wymaga roli admin
DELETE {{api}}/api/products/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
